## Test Summary Report — OpenCart Demo

### Project Information
- Application: OpenCart Demo
- Type: E-commerce web application
- Testing type: Manual testing
- Environment: Web (Desktop browser)
- URL: https://demo.opencart.com/

---

### Test Scope
The following areas were tested:
- Smoke testing of the application
- User registration
- User login
- Product page functionality
- Shopping cart functionality

Out of scope:
- Payment processing
- Backend and database testing
- Security testing
- Admin panel

---

### Testing Approach
Testing was performed using manual testing techniques.
Smoke testing was executed first to verify application stability.
After successful smoke testing, functional testing was performed using checklists.

---

### Test Artifacts
The following test artifacts were created:
- Smoke Checklist
- Registration Checklist
- Login Checklist
- Product Page Checklist
- Cart Checklist

---

### Test Execution Summary
- Total smoke test cases: Passed
- Functional testing status: Completed
- Critical defects: Not found
- Major defects: Not found

---

### Risks and Limitations
- Demo environment instability
- Possible data reset during testing
- Payment functionality is not available for testing

---

### Conclusion
Based on the performed testing, the application is considered stable and ready for further testing activities.
